{'symbol': 'PH', 'date': '2022-10-26 17:00:00', 'title': 'PARKER DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'CLEVELAND, OCT. 26, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- PARKER HANNIFIN CORPORATION (NYSE: PH), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN MOTION AND CONTROL TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $1.33 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF NOVEMBER 14, 2022. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE DECEMBER 2, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'PH', 'date': '2022-10-26 10:00:00', 'title': 'PARKER ELECTS WILLIAM “SKIP” BOWMAN AS VICE PRESIDENT AND PRESIDENT – FLUID CONNECTORS GROUP, EFFECTIVE JANUARY 1, 2023', 'text': 'CLEVELAND, OCT. 26, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- PARKER HANNIFIN CORPORATION (NYSE: PH), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN MOTION AND CONTROL TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS ELECTED WILLIAM R. “SKIP” BOWMAN, AS VICE PRESIDENT AND PRESIDENT – FLUID CONNECTORS GROUP, EFFECTIVE JANUARY 1, 2023. MR. BOWMAN WILL SUCCEED ANDREW D. ROSS, WHO, AS PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED, WAS ELECTED TO THE ROLE OF CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER, EFFECTIVE JANUARY 1, 2023.'}{'symbol': 'PH', 'date': '2022-10-26 09:15:00', 'title': 'PARKER ELECTS JENNIFER A. PARMENTIER AS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND ANDREW D.', 'text': '- THOMAS L. WILLIAMS TO CONTINUE AS EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN FOR TRANSITION PERIOD - THOMAS L. WILLIAMS TO CONTINUE AS EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN FOR TRANSITION PERIOD'}